sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant ENG as MaskingEngine (Facade)
    participant ALG as Algorithm Rules
    participant LLM as LLM Provider (Adapter)
    participant MRG as Merger
    participant DB as MongoDB


    U->>FE: Select checkboxes + custom queries
    U->>FE: Paste input text & click "Process"
    FE->>BE: POST /transactions {profile, choices, customQueries, inputText}


    BE->>DB: insert transaction (status=pending)


    BE->>ENG: process(inputText, profile, choices)
    ENG->>ALG: findMatches(input)
    ALG-->>ENG: changesA (spans w/ start,end,before,after)


    ENG->>LLM: extractSpans(input, customQueries)
    LLM-->>ENG: changesL (spans + confidence)


    ENG->>MRG: merge(changesA, changesL)
    MRG-->>ENG: changesFinal (non-overlapping)


    ENG-->>BE: {finalText, changesFinal, stats}


    BE->>DB: insert runs (algorithm, llm) & changes (per-actor)
    BE->>DB: insert changes (actor=final) + update transaction (status=success)


    BE-->>FE: {transactionId, finalText, changesFinal}
    FE-->>U: Render final text + table of changes